41
00:01:30,570 --> 00:01:33,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Let's go!</font>

42
00:01:39,490 --> 00:01:40,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

43
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:48,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Let's go,"
with so much energy...</font>

44
00:01:48,250 --> 00:01:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't act like a little kid!</font>

45
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh? You're in a bad mood.</font>

46
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:56,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because! Because!
It's in the middle of my training!</font>

47
00:01:56,550 --> 00:01:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are three steps
in the training, right?!</font>

48
00:01:59,050 --> 00:02:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm only done with the second step!</font>

49
00:02:04,310 --> 00:02:07,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can do the third step
even while walking.</font>

50
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What! Really?!</font>

51
00:02:13,690 --> 00:02:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A balloon?</font>

52
00:02:15,030 --> 00:02:15,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

53
00:02:21,990 --> 00:02:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this...?
An ordinary balloon?</font>

54
00:02:26,870 --> 00:02:31,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first step is "Spin"
The second step is "Power"</font>

55
00:02:34,380 --> 00:02:38,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And finally, the third step is this.</font>

56
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:43,300
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Ripple</font>

57
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one is "this"?!</font>

58
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch me, it looks as if
I am simply holding a balloon...</font>

59
00:03:12,830 --> 00:03:17,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You say it "looks as if,"
but nothing is really happening.</font>

60
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:21,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, I will do the same thing
on my left hand.</font>

61
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:26,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see what's really happening
inside the balloon.</font>

62
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:31,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow!</font>

63
00:03:31,980 --> 00:03:34,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chakra is randomly spinning
and going faster and faster...</font>

64
00:03:35,230 --> 00:03:39,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But still, it's perfectly round...
It's almost like...</font>

65
00:03:40,070 --> 00:03:42,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like a small typhoon, right?</font>

66
00:03:44,370 --> 00:03:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's happening in your left hand...</font>

67
00:03:47,330 --> 00:03:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is happening inside that balloon
in your right hand, too?</font>

68
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! That's right.</font>

69
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:56,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cool...</font>

70
00:03:56,960 --> 00:04:02,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The balloon isn't moving at all
even if he's spinning that much Chakra...</font>

71
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's more power than
that time the rubber ball popped,</font>

72
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it's spinning a lot more too!</font>

73
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, in this third step,</font>

74
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you've got to use 100% of
what you have learned...</font>

75
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and retain them.</font>

76
00:04:18,730 --> 00:04:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, while keeping
the "Spin" and the "Power" at their max,</font>

77
00:04:23,570 --> 00:04:26,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">imagine creating a single layer
within the balloon</font>

78
00:04:27,030 --> 00:04:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and compressing the Chakra within it.</font>

79
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

80
00:04:36,210 --> 00:04:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, this training is about keeping</font>

81
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the spin and power that I did
in the second step,</font>

82
00:04:40,130 --> 00:04:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and conversely,
trying not to pop a delicate balloon!</font>

83
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:46,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! That's the most perceptive
you've been so far!</font>

84
00:04:48,260 --> 00:04:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

85
00:04:49,470 --> 00:04:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, what's the point in going
to all the trouble?!</font>

86
00:04:56,150 --> 00:04:58,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In short, it means this.</font>

87
00:04:59,650 --> 00:05:03,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch! It's like this up until
the second step of the training.</font>

88
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:19,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, after you have mastered
the third step!</font>

89
00:05:29,550 --> 00:05:30,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is what happens!</font>

90
00:05:49,370 --> 00:05:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can keep this small typhoon
the size of your palm,</font>

91
00:05:53,370 --> 00:05:54,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the force won't disperse.</font>

92
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The spinning gets faster and faster</font>

93
00:05:57,500 --> 00:05:59,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the power gets
more and more compressed.</font>

94
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:04,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the destructive power
will reach its max.</font>

95
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:09,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, so, that's that.</font>

96
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:16,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I'll do this, too!</font>

97
00:06:33,490 --> 00:06:36,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, this feels right...</font>

98
00:06:42,670 --> 00:06:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

99
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:46,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Retain it here!</font>

100
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Retain...</font>

101
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:58,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Retain...</font>

102
00:07:03,230 --> 00:07:05,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No cutting-corners!</font>

103
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:09,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got to put out 100% spin and power,
and retain them.</font>

104
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:10,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You gotta be kidding...</font>

105
00:07:11,820 --> 00:07:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unless I can perfectly control all my power,
it's impossible!</font>

106
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I can see it...</font>

107
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This third step...</font>

108
00:07:24,290 --> 00:07:26,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's on a totally different level
compared to the others.</font>

109
00:07:27,050 --> 00:07:28,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you...</font>

110
00:07:28,590 --> 00:07:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With an achievement difficulty of Rank A,
it's a super advanced Ninjutsu.</font>

111
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:40,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'm done explaining!
We'll continue as we go on walking.</font>

112
00:07:41,690 --> 00:07:43,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey!</font>

113
00:07:43,690 --> 00:07:46,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't need to rush so much,
until I can properly...</font>

114
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:50,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have already wasted enough time
waiting for your body to recover.</font>

115
00:07:51,780 --> 00:07:55,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no guarantee that
Tsunade stays in this town much longer.</font>

116
00:07:56,030 --> 00:07:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

117
00:07:57,490 --> 00:07:59,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, but...</font>

118
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:01,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like an old acquaintance
is going to conveniently pop up</font>

119
00:08:01,910 --> 00:08:04,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and start talking about
the good old times with her...</font>

120
00:08:05,290 --> 00:08:06,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, let's go!</font>

121
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right...</font>

122
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see... Orochimaru.</font>

123
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:54,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd looked for you everywhere.</font>

124
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:57,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want from me
after so long a time?</font>

125
00:08:57,930 --> 00:09:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You aren't thinking of talking
about the old days...?</font>

126
00:09:01,930 --> 00:09:05,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, I need to ask you
for a little favor...</font>

127
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His heartbeat is fast...</font>

128
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From that complexion,
he must have a high fever.</font>

129
00:09:11,530 --> 00:09:13,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He must have been fatigued
for quite some time...</font>

130
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:15,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that arm...</font>

131
00:09:18,870 --> 00:09:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama.</font>

132
00:09:21,450 --> 00:09:23,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must have understood by now.</font>

133
00:09:23,950 --> 00:09:27,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go to someone else,
I don't treat anyone any more.</font>

134
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:29,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That won't do...</font>

135
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:33,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must know how serious
this wound is...</font>

136
00:09:34,170 --> 00:09:36,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one can treat this wound.</font>

137
00:09:38,010 --> 00:09:40,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Except for one of the Legendary "Sannin"</font>

138
00:09:40,430 --> 00:09:43,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who won her fame as
a medical specialist, Princess Tsunade...</font>

139
00:09:44,350 --> 00:09:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

140
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:53,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That arm...
it's not an ordinary wound.</font>

141
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:59,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A special Sealing Jutsu or something...?</font>

142
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:02,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What have you done?</font>

143
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:07,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it just happened...
when I killed the Third Hokage.</font>

144
00:10:11,250 --> 00:10:13,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... Really?</font>

145
00:10:14,210 --> 00:10:19,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph. Don't look so scary.</font>

146
00:10:20,050 --> 00:10:23,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anything that has a form
will one day decay...</font>

147
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:25,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same goes for humans.</font>

148
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must already know that too.</font>

149
00:10:39,860 --> 00:10:46,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For you have let two of
your most beloved ones die...</font>

150
00:11:05,010 --> 00:11:08,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let two of the most beloved ones die?</font>

151
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... He thinks of terrible things.</font>

152
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a really terrible way to die...</font>

153
00:11:30,210 --> 00:11:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

154
00:11:41,430 --> 00:11:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Poisoned...</font>

155
00:11:47,390 --> 00:11:48,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's fast!</font>

156
00:11:48,350 --> 00:11:49,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get out of my way!</font>

157
00:11:49,810 --> 00:11:50,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Won't let you!</font>

158
00:11:53,060 --> 00:11:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down, Shizune!</font>

159
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:13,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This attendant... is an expert.</font>

160
00:12:24,470 --> 00:12:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru...</font>

161
00:12:26,260 --> 00:12:29,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your personality's been like this
for a long time.</font>

162
00:12:34,900 --> 00:12:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you know my personality
very well...</font>

163
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So stop fooling around with me.</font>

164
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:02,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill you, bastard!</font>

165
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:05,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's powerful...</font>

166
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:11,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so scary...
she definitely must be single.</font>

167
00:13:13,850 --> 00:13:17,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade is impatient and short-tempered...</font>

168
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:25,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Naruto,
there's no time to be falling.</font>

169
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:27,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we don't hurry,</font>

170
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:30,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who knows where that shrew
will disappear again.</font>

171
00:13:30,830 --> 00:13:32,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you, Pervy Sage!</font>

172
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's no way to speak to
a hard-working apprentice!</font>

173
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:40,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up. Tsunade is the first priority now,
not you.</font>

174
00:13:41,710 --> 00:13:44,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, what the hell!</font>

175
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:53,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To have this Pervy Sage come
all the way to meet her...</font>

176
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who could this Kunoichi Tsunade be?</font>

177
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:01,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hope she's still here...</font>

178
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We didn't come here to fight.</font>

179
00:14:10,490 --> 00:14:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We just want to negotiate with you!</font>

180
00:14:13,830 --> 00:14:14,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Negotiate?</font>

181
00:14:15,290 --> 00:14:16,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

182
00:14:16,830 --> 00:14:18,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make me laugh!</font>

183
00:14:22,590 --> 00:14:25,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've already told you once.
Get out of my sight!</font>

184
00:14:26,300 --> 00:14:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't do that.</font>

185
00:14:29,220 --> 00:14:30,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get out of my sight.</font>

186
00:14:30,890 --> 00:14:34,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are the only one
who can treat Orochimaru-sama's arm.</font>

187
00:14:35,390 --> 00:14:36,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get out of my sight.</font>

188
00:14:37,230 --> 00:14:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're not asking you to do it for free.</font>

189
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:40,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's make a deal!</font>

190
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:44,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll count up to five.
Leave before I'm done.</font>

191
00:14:47,190 --> 00:14:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or else, I'll make you disappear myself.</font>

192
00:14:50,410 --> 00:14:54,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please calm down.
It won't be a bad deal for you...</font>

193
00:14:54,490 --> 00:14:55,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five...</font>

194
00:14:57,540 --> 00:14:58,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Four...</font>

195
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:02,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three...</font>

196
00:15:05,130 --> 00:15:05,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two...</font>

197
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:09,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One...</font>

198
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:16,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll resurrect the little brother
and man, both of whom you loved...</font>

199
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:24,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the Forbidden Jutsu I've developed.</font>

200
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:45,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since we haven't disappeared yet,</font>

201
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:51,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm guessing that the deal is made?</font>

202
00:15:57,850 --> 00:16:00,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. I do know this young lady...</font>

203
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:01,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

204
00:16:02,190 --> 00:16:03,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

205
00:16:03,770 --> 00:16:06,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To win back the money she lost here,
I think she said...</font>

206
00:16:06,940 --> 00:16:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she was going over there.</font>

207
00:16:09,490 --> 00:16:11,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Spin... Power...</font>

208
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Letting them out to their max
and retain it...</font>

209
00:16:15,870 --> 00:16:17,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, kid.</font>

210
00:16:17,490 --> 00:16:18,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

211
00:16:18,450 --> 00:16:21,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wanna gamble a bit, too?</font>

212
00:16:21,580 --> 00:16:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there? Where is that?</font>

213
00:16:24,630 --> 00:16:25,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

214
00:16:26,340 --> 00:16:28,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See, if the total number of the pips
on these dices</font>

215
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:30,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">comes out as even numbers,
that's "Cho"</font>

216
00:16:30,130 --> 00:16:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and if it's odd, that's "Han."</font>

217
00:16:31,970 --> 00:16:36,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! I am training right now,
don't bug me!</font>

218
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:39,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What nonsense!
This is a gambling house.</font>

219
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:43,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instead of that balloon,
let's play with these.</font>

220
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:48,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way! I don't have any time
to be playing with those dice!</font>

221
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:50,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ha, what a boring kid!</font>

222
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:51,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

223
00:16:51,990 --> 00:16:54,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... can you tell me where that is?</font>

224
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:58,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you can't expect things to be free
in a gambling house, you know?</font>

225
00:16:58,660 --> 00:16:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

226
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's make a deal.
The information will be free if you win...</font>

227
00:17:10,550 --> 00:17:13,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if you lose,
I'll give it to you for 1000 ryo.</font>

228
00:17:13,340 --> 00:17:14,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

229
00:17:14,930 --> 00:17:16,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So choose, odd or even!</font>

230
00:17:16,970 --> 00:17:18,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Here we go...</font>

231
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:28,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, so...
since I am exactly 50 years old.</font>

232
00:17:29,730 --> 00:17:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go for... even!</font>

233
00:17:31,610 --> 00:17:33,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's odd, I win...</font>

234
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:36,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll open it now.</font>

235
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no! 2 and 5, odd!</font>

236
00:17:46,670 --> 00:17:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What the hell...?!</font>

237
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:49,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">1000 ryo...</font>

238
00:17:52,170 --> 00:17:53,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice, Naruto!</font>

239
00:17:55,970 --> 00:17:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like I won...</font>

240
00:18:00,350 --> 00:18:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! It didn't work again!</font>

241
00:18:06,890 --> 00:18:07,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Retain...</font>

242
00:18:11,770 --> 00:18:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where shall I look next?</font>

243
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:29,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, she's nowhere to be found!</font>

244
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:40,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm? Me?</font>

245
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:45,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lotto?</font>

246
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kids, grownups, everyone loves it.</font>

247
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come and play with
this fun, fun Lotto.</font>

248
00:18:51,810 --> 00:18:53,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's one that you know
the result right away.</font>

249
00:18:53,900 --> 00:18:54,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one do you want?</font>

250
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:03,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really, you are so much cuter
being chubby!</font>

251
00:19:03,950 --> 00:19:07,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe he won
with just one draw.</font>

252
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:10,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's very talented in this...</font>

253
00:19:11,710 --> 00:19:14,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">though his talent in Jutsu
is still immature.</font>

254
00:19:15,380 --> 00:19:17,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... anyhow...</font>

255
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where could have Tsunade gone?</font>

256
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She couldn't have gone that far
in this short amount of time.</font>

257
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess we'll have to
search for her from a higher place.</font>

258
00:19:31,690 --> 00:19:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I remember it correctly,
this is a castle town.</font>

259
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we go up to the castle...</font>

260
00:19:37,650 --> 00:19:39,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! This way!</font>

261
00:19:50,870 --> 00:19:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you want to see those two...
Tsunade?</font>

262
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:04,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nawaki... Dan...</font>

263
00:20:14,190 --> 00:20:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I treat your arms,
what do you intend to do with them?</font>

264
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I don't like to lie...</font>

265
00:20:27,370 --> 00:20:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I will tell you the truth.</font>

266
00:20:36,750 --> 00:20:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey! Where is the castle?</font>

267
00:20:45,050 --> 00:20:46,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not there...?</font>

268
00:20:49,140 --> 00:20:52,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In addition to getting what I want...</font>

269
00:20:58,190 --> 00:21:03,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, I will completely destroy
the Leaf Village!</font>

270
00:21:09,370 --> 00:21:14,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

271
00:21:09,370 --> 00:21:14,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

272
00:21:14,330 --> 00:21:19,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

273
00:21:14,330 --> 00:21:19,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

274
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

275
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

276
00:21:27,430 --> 00:21:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">wakiyaku dakedo</font></font></b></font>

277
00:21:27,430 --> 00:21:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">it's a secondary role</font></font></b></font>

278
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:36,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kage no hito dakedo</font></font></b></font>

279
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:36,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a role in the shadows</font></font></b></font>

280
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:41,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume to mukiau toki kurai</font></font></b></font>

281
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:41,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but in reaching for that dream</font></font></b></font>

282
00:21:41,780 --> 00:21:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">man naka ni isasete shoujiki ni isasete</font></font></b></font>

283
00:21:41,780 --> 00:21:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">let us stay centered, let us stay true</font></font></b></font>

284
00:21:47,620 --> 00:21:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo nan toka akiramezu ni</font></font></b></font>

285
00:21:47,620 --> 00:21:52,390
